jk_os: rounded window corners and a hairline outline for Aurorae (v2) themes.

Two theme settings the C++ Aurorae didn't have: [Layout] CornerRadius, the
radius KWin rounds the whole window with (the application's content too, as
Breeze does without borders), and [General] ActiveOutlineColor /
InactiveOutlineColor, a 1px outline KWin draws around the window. Both are
off (0, transparent) for themes that don't set them, and when maximized.
With rounded corners the shadow reaches into the corners, as Breeze's does.

